&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As the Founding PM for Numeral, you’ll be learning about our ideal customers, defining the user journey, understanding pains faced by our customers and refining our product in partnership with engineering and driving top line growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
