&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take true ownership of your work and lead key components of our product roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Make key architectural decisions in our tech stack to support scaling up to 100M+ transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
